# Marketplays — Buyer Portal

**Source of truth:** `docs/marketplays_cursor_rules.md` **Section 6** (+ always **Sections 1–2**). Design tokens: **Section 3**.

## Hard rules
- Entry is the **Live Map** (`/map` or `/dashboard/buyer`), not a list-first view
- Pin colours from Section 3.1 tokens only; recalculate on every filter apply
- Cluster click = zoom only; single unclustered pin opens slide-in panel
- Map re-query: pan >25% viewport or zoom ≥2 levels, debounced 400ms
- Slide-in ~300px from right; double-click → `/listings/[id]`
- Filter order fixed: Location → Radius → Asset Type → Audience → Price → Availability → CIS → Booking Type
- Cards show £/week (`price_per_day × 7`); daily rate only at booking confirmation
- Do not invent booking status labels outside Section 1.3
